I just got S4 hibernation working perfectly (not even any stack traces) on my 
Evo N610c ^_^

The system is running Mandrake10 with kernel 2.6.6, acpi with a modified DSDT, 
and the latest (2.0.0.74 with incremental patch) swsup2.

